cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cartolex, please cite it as below."
title: "cartolex"
abstract: >-
  cartolex maps a research field from the texts of the people who work in it:
  keywords, themes and a two-dimensional atlas, with an offline site to share it.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/cartolex/cartolex"
keywords:
  - science mapping
  - keyword extraction
  - text mining
  - bibliometrics
  - topic maps
